==English==

===Etymology===
From an {{der|en|alg}} word ''torope'' ("little [[turtle]]"); compare {{cog|abe|tolba||turtle}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[North American]] [[turtle]]s, of the [[family]] [[Emydidae]], that live in [[fresh]] or [[brackish]] [[water]].

